The latest information in the record shows Coena Brackwood living in Kelwick (Chapter 26). While other characters moved to Larkmere (Elnelle Orlworth in Chapter 7, Sedrek in Chapter 24, Hadette Lindick in Chapter 35, Cobin in Chapter 35, etc.), there is no evidence that Coena Brackwood herself ever lived in Larkmere. Chapter 35 (¶5623) even states: "The eldest daughter of Illde Brackwood talked for weeks of going to Larkmere, yet in the end stayed where she was" — indicating she considered going but did not actually move there.

